documentation inside the flash image itself. Each release therefore publishes
the complete third-party copyright notices, license conditions, and disclaimers
alongside the firmware binaries in the GitHub Release notes, in
`mimhid_firmware-THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES-<version>.txt`, and in
